  {
   "id": "dreamcore-253474@major-2025-05-20",
   "gameId": "dreamcore-253474",
   "displayName": "Playrooms Update Coming June 17",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2025-05-20T15:00:02.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "I’ve seen a lot of questions about Playrooms lately, so let’s clear a few things up.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "First: forget what you know from Dreampools or Eternal Suburbia. Every Dreamcore map is a self-contained experience with its own look, atmosphere, and mechanics. Nothing gets recycled.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Dreamcore is all about pushing the boundaries of liminal design, and Playrooms is no exception. Expect:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "A spectrum of distinct visual styles",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Bold, unexpected colour palettes",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Zones crafted to spark very different moods",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Over the last two months I’ve combed through all your feedback on Dreampools and Eternal Suburbia, and many of those ideas are making their way into Playrooms. (Plenty more surprises are being saved for future maps, so you won’t see everything at once.)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "And now the news you’re waiting for: the Playrooms showcase is live, and the update launches on 17 June. Watch the trailer to see why this map is truly unlike anything so far.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Stay tuned for more news here - https://discord.gg/vTdx64cBmh",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
